{
  "info": {
    "name": "SPPG Dashboard — Auth (Fase 1)",
    "description": "Endpoint fase 1: health check, /api/me (find-or-create user), dan contoh route ber-guard /api/admin/ping.\n\nSetiap endpoint punya varian happy-path plus varian ditolak (401 tanpa token / token invalid, 403 role tidak berwenang), karena yang diuji di fase ini justru penolakannya.\n\n**Cara pakai**\n1. Import environment `local.postman_environment.json`, isi `auth0_domain`, `auth0_audience`, `auth0_client_id`, `auth0_client_secret`, dan kredensial akun uji (`username` / `password`).\n2. Jalankan `Auth / Get Access Token` — token disimpan otomatis ke variabel `access_token`, dan roles-nya dicetak di console.\n3. Jalankan request lain. Auth bearer sudah di-set di level collection.\n\nLogin-nya satu request saja: mau super admin atau akun low-privilege, bedanya cuma kredensial di `username`/`password`. Untuk menguji yang butuh 403, ganti kredensial ke akun non-super-admin lalu login ulang.\n\nRequest token memakai Resource Owner Password grant varian **password-realm**, yang menyebut connection-nya eksplisit lewat `auth0_connection` — jadi tidak bergantung pada setelan tenant *Default Directory*, yang kalau kosong membuat `grant_type: password` biasa gagal untuk semua client. Grant ini harus diaktifkan dulu di Auth0 (Application > Advanced Settings > Grant Types > Password) dan **hanya** untuk tenant staging/dev — jangan diaktifkan di prod. Kalau tidak mau mengaktifkannya, login lewat Universal Login, salin access token dari browser, lalu tempel manual ke variabel `access_token`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{access_token}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "http://localhost:8080", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "access_token", "value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "description": "Ambil access token dari Auth0. Token tidak pernah ditulis ke file — hanya disimpan sebagai variabel environment Postman.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Access Token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// Auth0 menaruh sebab penolakan di error_description. Tanpa guard ini baris",
                  "// di bawahnya melempar duluan, dan Postman hanya menampilkan 'Something went",
                  "// wrong while running your scripts' — pesan Auth0-nya tidak pernah kelihatan.",
                  "const ok = pm.response.code === 200;",
                  "pm.test('token diterbitkan', () => {",
                  "    if (!ok) pm.expect.fail(pm.response.code + ' — ' + pm.response.text());",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "// Payload JWT itu base64url: '-' dan '_' bukan alfabet base64, dan atob()",
                  "// menolaknya. Tanpa terjemahan ini token yang sah pun bikin script crash.",
                  "const decodeClaims = (jwt) => {",
                  "    const s = jwt.split('.')[1].replace(/-/g, '+').replace(/_/g, '/');",
                  "    return JSON.parse(atob(s + '='.repeat((4 - (s.length % 4)) % 4)));",
                  "};",
                  "",
                  "if (ok) {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.test('respons berisi access_token', () => pm.expect(body.access_token).to.be.a('string'));",
                  "    pm.environment.set('access_token', body.access_token);",
                  "",
                  "    // Sanity check: token harus untuk audience API kita, bukan /userinfo.",
                  "    const claims = decodeClaims(body.access_token);",
                  "    const aud = [].concat(claims.aud);",
                  "    pm.test('audience sesuai', () => pm.expect(aud).to.include(pm.environment.get('auth0_audience')));",
                  "",
                  "    const rolesClaim = pm.environment.get('auth0_roles_claim');",
                  "    pm.test('custom claim roles ada di token', () => {",
                  "        pm.expect(claims[rolesClaim], 'roles claim ' + rolesClaim).to.be.an('array');",
                  "    });",
                  "",
                  "    // Role tidak di-assert di sini: request ini dipakai untuk akun mana pun.",
                  "    // Yang menentukan lolos/tidaknya guard adalah request /api/admin/ping.",
                  "    console.log('roles:', claims[rolesClaim]); // sengaja hanya roles, bukan token penuh",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"grant_type\": \"http://auth0.com/oauth/grant-type/password-realm\",\n  \"realm\": \"{{auth0_connection}}\",\n  \"username\": \"{{username}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\",\n  \"audience\": \"{{auth0_audience}}\",\n  \"scope\": \"openid profile email\",\n  \"client_id\": \"{{auth0_client_id}}\",\n  \"client_secret\": \"{{auth0_client_secret}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "https://{{auth0_domain}}/oauth/token",
              "protocol": "https",
              "host": ["{{auth0_domain}}"],
              "path": ["oauth", "token"]
            },
            "description": "Login untuk akun mana pun — super admin hasil `npm run seed:superadmin` maupun akun `internal`/`public`. Bedanya cuma isi `username`/`password` di environment; alurnya sama persis, jadi request-nya satu saja. Selalu https."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /health",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('status ok', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().status).to.eql('ok'));",
                  "pm.test('tidak butuh autentikasi', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.not.eql(401));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/health",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["health"]
            },
            "description": "Dipakai health check ALB. Sengaja tanpa auth dan tanpa rate limit."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Me",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /api/me — valid token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('mengembalikan row Postgres, bukan payload token', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(body.id, 'id').to.be.a('string');",
                  "    pm.expect(body.role, 'role').to.be.oneOf(['SUPER_ADMIN', 'DATA_ADMIN', 'INTERNAL', 'PUBLIC']);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('tidak membocorkan kredensial apa pun', () => {",
                  "    const keys = Object.keys(body).map((k) => k.toLowerCase());",
                  "    ['password', 'token', 'secret', 'auth0sub'].forEach((k) => pm.expect(keys).to.not.include(k));",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.environment.set('my_role', body.role);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/me",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "me"]
            },
            "description": "Panggilan pertama akan membuat row `users` (find-or-create). Panggilan berikutnya tidak menulis apa pun — jalankan dua kali untuk membuktikan idempotensi."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /api/me — tanpa token (401)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('401 Unauthorized', () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));",
                  "pm.test('error code jelas', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().error).to.eql('unauthorized'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/me",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "me"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /api/me — token invalid (401)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('401 Unauthorized', () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));",
                  "",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('pesan error tidak membocorkan detail internal', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(body.message).to.eql('Invalid or expired token');",
                  "    const text = JSON.stringify(body).toLowerCase();",
                  "    ['jwks', 'signature', 'kid', 'stack', 'prisma'].forEach((t) => pm.expect(text).to.not.include(t));",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "not.a.valid.jwt", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/me",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "me"]
            },
            "description": "Token expired, salah signature, dan salah audience semuanya harus menghasilkan respons yang identik — alasan penolakan tidak boleh bocor ke client."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Admin (role guard)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /api/admin/ping — super admin (200)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('lolos guard', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().ok).to.be.true);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/admin/ping",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "admin", "ping"]
            },
            "description": "Contoh route dengan `requireRole('SUPER_ADMIN')`. Endpoint fitur (pengeluaran, references, dokumen) menyusul di fase berikutnya dengan guard yang sama."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /api/admin/ping — role tidak berwenang (403)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('403 Forbidden, bukan 401', () => pm.response.to.have.status(403));",
                  "pm.test('dibedakan dari kegagalan autentikasi', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().error).to.eql('forbidden');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/admin/ping",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "admin", "ping"]
            },
            "description": "Token-nya sah — yang ditolak adalah role-nya. Isi `username`/`password` di environment dengan akun non-super-admin, jalankan `Get Access Token`, baru request ini."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /api/admin/ping — tanpa token (401)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": ["pm.test('401 Unauthorized', () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));"]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/admin/ping",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "admin", "ping"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Rate limit",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /api/me — cek header rate limit",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('header RateLimit terpasang', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.headers.has('RateLimit-Limit')).to.be.true;",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.headers.has('RateLimit-Remaining')).to.be.true;",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "// Untuk memicu 429: turunkan AUTH_RATE_LIMIT_MAX di .env, restart,",
                  "// lalu jalankan request ini berulang lewat Collection Runner.",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 429) {",
                  "    pm.test('429 dengan error code jelas', () => {",
                  "        pm.expect(pm.response.json().error).to.eql('too_many_requests');",
                  "    });",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/me",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "me"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
